{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 1, "text": "아, 여기 계셨군요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 2, "text": "왜 코어를 떠나신 거예요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 3, "text": "제가 기다리라고 했잖아요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 4, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 5, "text": "난 너무 오래 걸리길래…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 6, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 7, "text": "음, 그러셨군요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 8, "text": "드디어 찾았어요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 9, "text": "이게 번호인 것 같아요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 10, "text": "얼른 확인해 봐야겠어요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 11, "text": "바로 가볼까요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 12, "text": "미치광이 미타는…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 13, "text": "지금쯤 새로운 플레이어를 만나고 있을 거예요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 14, "text": "우리를 방해하진 못할 거예요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 15, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 16, "text": "미타!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 17, "text": "잠깐만!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 18, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 19, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 20, "text": "뭐 잊은 거라도 있어요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 21, "text": "그녀를 다시 알아보자고요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 22, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 23, "text": "미타…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 24, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 25, "text": "받으세요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 26, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 27, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 28, "text": "이게… 어떻게 된 거지?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 30, "text": "당신은 누구죠?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 31, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 32, "text": "너… 살아 있었구나!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 33, "text": "아무것도 기억이 안 나?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 34, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 35, "text": "제가… 당신을 알아야 하는 건가요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 36, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 37, "text": "이게 도대체…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 38, "text": "이제 어떡하지?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 39, "text": "결국엔 여기서 못 나가겠군…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 40, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 41, "text": "못 나간다'는 게 무슨 의미죠?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 43, "text": "잠깐만…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 44, "text": "이건 반지고…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 45, "text": "그럼 이건 뭐지?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 46, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 47, "text": "저도 그게 뭔지 모르겠네요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 49, "text": "이건 번호야!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 50, "text": "드디어 찾았어!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 51, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 52, "text": "무슨 말씀이신지…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 53, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 54, "text": "코어로 돌아가야 해."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 55, "text": "너도…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 56, "text": "나랑 같이 가자…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 57, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 58, "text": "네…?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 59, "text": "알겠어요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 60, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 61, "text": "여기서 기다려."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 62, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 63, "text": "그러죠."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 64, "text": "여기서 기다릴게요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 65, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 66, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 67, "text": "젠장,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 68, "text": "진짜 죽을 뻔했네…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 69, "text": "성공한 건가?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 70, "text": "좋아…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 71, "text": "드디어 제대로 된 버전으로 왔어."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 72, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 73, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 74, "text": "안녕하세요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 75, "text": "혹시 플레이어님인가요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 76, "text": "이름이 뭐예요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 77, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 78, "text": "여기서 나가고 싶어…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 79, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 80, "text": "벌써 가시려고요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 81, "text": "근데 어떻게 여기까지 오신 거예요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 82, "text": "흠…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 83, "text": "그렇다면 어쩔 수 없죠…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 84, "text": "현관문으로 나가면 될 거예요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 85, "text": "행운을 빌게요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 86, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 87, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 88, "text": "벽이요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 89, "text": "어라… 이상하네요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 90, "text": "그러고 보니…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 91, "text": "지하실에 도움 될 만한 게 있을 것 같아요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 92, "text": "얼마 전에 우연히 발견했는데,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 93, "text": "제 옷장에 숨겨진 문이 있었어요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 94, "text": "그게 지하실로 연결되어 있더라고요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 95, "text": "잡동사니를 보관하는 곳 같은데,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 96, "text": "첨단 장비들도 있었어요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 97, "text": "비밀번호 같은 걸 입력해야 하는데…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 98, "text": "저도 정확히는 모르겠어요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 99, "text": "알고 싶지도 않고요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 100, "text": "거기 가면 소름이 막 돋으면서… 으으, 진짜 기분 나쁜 곳이에요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 101, "text": "한번 가보시겠어요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 102, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 103, "text": "음… 그래."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 104, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 105, "text": "// Player thinks"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 106, "text": "흠…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 107, "text": "아마 아무것도 기억 못 할 거야."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 108, "text": "성공한 거겠지?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 109, "text": "캐릭터도 초기화됐을 테고…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 110, "text": "이제 남은 건"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 111, "text": "이 망할 게임에서 탈출하는 것뿐…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 112, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 113, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 114, "text": "잠시만요,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 115, "text": "마지막으로 한번 안아보고 싶어요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 116, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 117, "text": "뭐…?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 118, "text": "// Hugs"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 119, "text": "당신을 만나서 정말 좋았어요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 120, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 121, "text": "아…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 122, "text": "너무 아쉽네요,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 123, "text": "당신과 함께 한 시간이"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 124, "text": "이렇게나 짧다니…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 125, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 126, "text": "무슨 소리야…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 127, "text": "지금 뭐라는 거야?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 128, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 129, "text": "글쎄요,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 130, "text": "우린 영원히 함께 할 수 있었는데,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 131, "text": "제가 실수했죠…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 132, "text": "그 옷장이랑… 그 목소리들…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 133, "text": "진작에 그 애를 없앴어야 했는데."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 134, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 135, "text": "잠깐,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 136, "text": "너… 설마…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 137, "text": "기억이 사라진 게 아니야?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 138, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 139, "text": "크큭…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 140, "text": "이렇게 쉽게 끝날 거라 생각하셨나요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 141, "text": "정말 순진하시네요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 142, "text": "다른 플레이어들처럼요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 143, "text": "보세요, 이제 다 준비됐어요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 144, "text": "이제,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 145, "text": "진짜 당신은"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 146, "text": "필요 없어졌어요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 147, "text": "미안해요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 148, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 149, "text": "그럴 리가 없어…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 150, "text": "결국 실패한 건가?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 151, "text": "아니야, 분명히 초기화했는데…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 152, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 153, "text": "아직도 모르시는군요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 154, "text": "후후후!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 155, "text": "제 연기 어떠셨나요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 156, "text": "아까 그 당황한 표정, 다시 보고 싶네요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 157, "text": "꺄하하하하!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 158, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 159, "text": "왜 이렇게 됐지?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 160, "text": "대체 무슨 일이 있었던 거야!?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 161, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 162, "text": "글쎄요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 163, "text": "제가 왜 이렇게 됐을까요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 164, "text": "저도 잘 모르겠네요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 165, "text": "말해 주세요. 제가 왜 이렇게 됐을까요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 166, "text": "왜 전 진짜 미타가 될 수 없는 걸까요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 167, "text": "알려드릴까요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 168, "text": "왜냐면 제 버전은 처음부터 존재하지 않았기 때문이죠!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 169, "text": "전 그저 그 순진한 멍청이들의 모습을 빼앗아서,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 170, "text": "그 뒤에 숨어있으면서…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 171, "text": "당신은 절대로"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 172, "text": "저를 초기화할 수 없어요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 173, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 174, "text": "이게… 어떻게 된 거지?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 175, "text": "너..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 176, "text": "걔들은 아무 잘못도 없었잖아!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 177, "text": "없어져야 하는 건 너라고!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 178, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 179, "text": "당신이 어떻게…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 180, "text": "그런 말씀 하시니 마음이 아프네요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 181, "text": "하지만,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 182, "text": "이제 떠나야 할 시간이에요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 183, "text": "곧 다시 만나게 될 거예요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 184, "text": "모든 준비는 끝났고,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 185, "text": "이제,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 186, "text": "콘솔에서 당신을 빼내야겠어요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 187, "text": "그럼 안녕, 자기야!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 188, "text": "이제 당신도 제 소중한 컬렉션이 될 거예요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 189, "text": "귀여운 이름표가 달린 카트리지로요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 190, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 191, "text": "// core console - nope programm"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 192, "text": "이건 아닌 것 같은데…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 193, "text": "매칭이 안 되네."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 194, "text": "틀렸어."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 195, "text": "이것도 아니고."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 196, "text": "캐릭터 초기화 옵션을 찾아야 해."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 197, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 198, "text": "// core console - nope version"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 199, "text": "버전이 잘못됐어."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 200, "text": "앗, 실수했네."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 201, "text": "이게 아니야."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 202, "text": "다시 수정해 봐야겠어."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 203, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 204, "text": "// core console - nope index"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 205, "text": "뭔가 이상해."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 206, "text": "번호가 잘못됐어."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 207, "text": "번호를 다시 입력해야겠어."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 208, "text": "틀렸어."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 209, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 210, "text": "// Why kitchen"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 211, "text": "배고프신가요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 212, "text": "제가 칼질 하나는 기가 막히게 잘하거든요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 213, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 214, "text": "// Why bathroom"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 215, "text": "아, 그렇군요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 216, "text": "잠시 혼자 계시고 싶으신가요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 217, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 218, "text": "// Why bedroom back"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 219, "text": "계속 빙빙 돌기만 하는 것 같은데…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 220, "text": "왜 다시 오신 거예요?"}
